{"t":"PSX","n":"Phillips 66","nKo":"필립스 66","ex":"NYSE","cur":"USD","px":237.22,"chg":-2.11,"chgPct":-0.00882,"prev":239.33,"dayH":243.38,"dayL":236.34,"w52H":299.39,"w52L":127.16,"vol":3383063,"avgVol":3719240,"mcap":92532965376,"pe":7.61,"fpe":7.5,"eps":31.18,"feps":31.62,"pb":2.7,"div":5.32,"divY":0.0224,"beta":0.67,"short":7406742,"shortPct":0.0219,"shortRatio":3.05,"prof":{"c":"United States","cKo":"미국","s":"Energy","sKo":"에너지","i":"Oil & Gas Refining & Marketing","iKo":"석유 및 가스 정제 및 마케팅","city":"Houston","emp":12600,"web":"https://www.phillips66.com","sum":"Phillips 66 operates as an integrated downstream energy provider in the United States, the United Kingdom, Germany, and internationally. It operates through five segments: Midstream, Chemicals, Refining, Marketing and Specialties (M&S), and Renewable Fuels. The Midstream segment provides crude oil and refined petroleum product transportation, terminaling, and storage services, as well as natural gas and natural gas liquids (NGL) gathering, processing, transportation, fractionation, storage and marketing services. It also exports liquefied petroleum gas. The Chemicals segment produces and markets ethylene and other olefin products; aromatics and styrenics products, such as benzene, cyclohexane, styrene, and polystyrene; various specialty chemical products, including organosulfur chemicals, ","sumKo":"Phillips 66은 미국, 영국, 독일 및 국제적으로 통합 다운스트림 에너지 공급업체로 운영되고 있습니다. Midstream, Chemicals, Refining, Marketing and Specialties(M&S), Renewable Fuels의 5개 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 미드스트림 부문은 원유 및 정제 석유 제품 운송, 터미널링 및 저장 서비스는 물론 천연 가스 및 천연 가스 액체(NGL) 수집, 처리, 운송, 분류, 저장 및 마케팅 서비스를 제공합니다. 액화석유가스도 수출하고 있다. 화학 부문은 에틸렌 및 기타 올레핀 제품을 생산 및 판매합니다. 벤젠, 시클로헥산, 스티렌, 폴리스티렌 등의 방향족 및 스티렌계 제품; 유기황화학제품을 비롯한 다양한 특수화학제품,"},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":175702000000,"ni":11024000000},{"y":2023,"rev":149890000000,"ni":7015000000},{"y":2024,"rev":145496000000,"ni":2117000000},{"y":2025,"rev":136560000000,"ni":4403000000}],"quarterly":[{"q":"4Q2025","rev